decision_text:
Cursor v3 finding: hand-rolling {'event_id': body.get(...)} dicts at every guard call site is fragile (key drift between scope_event_id / event_id / scope_event). NEW required helper:

  def _scope_body(self, body: dict) -> dict:
      return {'event_id': body.get('scope_event_id') or body.get('event_id')}

Every guard MUST call:
  if not self._assert_event_scope(self._scope_body(body), allow_missing=True):
      return

11 existing call sites (LDs 455+456 era) migrated cosmetically; ~43 NEW guards use the helper from creation. Verification gate asserts grep_count(_assert_event_scope) ≥ grep_count(_scope_body) (every guard uses the helper).
